"d002/f617"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "54626647",
"en_raw": "...The redevelopment area never developed?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ec6871b8",
"en_raw": "No way, you can get in there?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "89017a6c",
"en_raw": "I've been really"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "d3e3042f",
"en_raw": "curious about it for a while"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "be69162b",
"en_raw": "Nishi told me"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "9dceb1a3",
"en_raw": "there's a part of the fence"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "dadc6cca",
"en_raw": "that's torn"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "b780f64e",
"en_raw": "Okay, Shiina, today we explore"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "c48a0a7b",
"en_raw": "Wait a second"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "49157098",
"en_raw": "But according to Kume"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "d8ea677f",
"en_raw": "it's dangerous there"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "0216f41a",
"en_raw": "In what way?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f6ec844a",
"en_raw": "Well, how do I put it..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "c0b808bf",
"en_raw": "From Kume's perspective..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "05119714",
"en_raw": "He'll probably say ghosts from"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "a5411f8d",
"en_raw": "the base days appear, right?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "e7725f39",
"en_raw": "That's stupid"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "732eacf9",
"en_raw": "But I often hear stories of kids"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "809348e4",
"en_raw": "who went in and had accidents"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ea1434dc",
"en_raw": "...Okay, Shiina, you"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "79053a07",
"en_raw": "have a strong penlight, right?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "2f848a49",
"en_raw": "Yeah, I brought it"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "c0d4c5a2",
"en_raw": "Good, then you lead"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "554538fb",
"en_raw": "Then, Nao"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "4205183b",
"en_raw": "we're going now"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "46b22515",
"en_raw": "Cowards can"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b6c1f5de",
"en_raw": "sleep at home"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "707fdd6c",
"en_raw": "Kume was really scared telling it"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "47c19254",
"en_raw": "and Yuasa and the others might be there"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f939c410",
"en_raw": "Got it, got it"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d376a2e4",
"en_raw": "Where's the hole in the fence?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "9ff58d1b",
"en_raw": "Behind the pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "2d9a3bde",
"en_raw": "near the parking lot, I think..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8c245812",
"en_raw": "Thanks, Nao"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "3090b6fe",
"en_raw": "You can go home now"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "20951a08",
"en_raw": "Well, I guess"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "1d1901d1",
"en_raw": "we should be thankful"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "324d861c",
"en_raw": "that we got out alive"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2211186a",
"en_raw": "Thanks, thanks"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "b5583d19",
"en_raw": "I never want to go back"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "7701e6f8",
"en_raw": "But that graffiti"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "29e7a361",
"en_raw": "what was it?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "a625ed9d",
"en_raw": "I don't know"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "e3842809",
"en_raw": "For just a prank scribble..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "8ddddbb8",
"en_raw": "Let's stop, Sango"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "d4979d8d",
"en_raw": "Kume was right"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "5b9e3dd3",
"en_raw": "There's something there"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "ebfd1934",
"en_raw": "There are lots"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "81fe85e1",
"en_raw": "Bugs, bugs"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "1d813e6e",
"en_raw": "little kids"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "b7342499",
"en_raw": "and... bugs"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "e66d2470",
"en_raw": "Then, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "a0bdc449",
"en_raw": "shall we go again?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "aa8a731b",
"en_raw": "Yeah, Sango"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "b35811cb",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will hold the penlight!"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "c1281d38",
"en_raw": "Shiina, are you really"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "7e07c144",
"en_raw": "going into the redevelopment area again?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "c3b9266b",
"en_raw": "So if you don't like it"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "dfb6a56b",
"en_raw": "you don't have to come"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "f8862002",
"en_raw": "I can't do that"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "a27995ef",
"en_raw": "If something happens to you two"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "e14e0fb9",
"en_raw": "in a place like that..."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "28bfd489",
"en_raw": "Oh, cool"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "2a5f4153",
"en_raw": "Nao is a little cool right now"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "52bbcf13",
"en_raw": "Nao-kun is cool, you know"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "8a3a9326",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "c6384da5",
"en_raw": "There was a kid"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "7316dcd6",
"en_raw": "A kid smaller than Kou-kun"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "fd30cad2",
"en_raw": "you see"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "97b5eb17",
"en_raw": "Shiina, is that true?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "c48d4f52",
"en_raw": "Yeah, we played with Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "97bed9ed",
"en_raw": "Nao, what were the kid accidents"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "c2506538",
"en_raw": "from before like?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "6273801a",
"en_raw": "I don't know the details, but..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "3da2c2b2",
"en_raw": "However you think about it, it's bad"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "3141f4cd",
"en_raw": "That place was dangerous"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "281bd1c6",
"en_raw": "even for us..."
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "6fff796c",
"en_raw": "He must have come in through"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "8c777b44",
"en_raw": "the hole in that fence"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "feb24154",
"en_raw": "That kid might have seen"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "e863fe71",
"en_raw": "us going in..."
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "a56d9390",
"en_raw": "That's totally our fault..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "763cbd4d",
"en_raw": "There will definitely be an accident"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "5bcede7a",
"en_raw": "Nao, come on, emergency dispatch!"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "6677278a",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "f701dd3c",
"en_raw": "Kids copy things, so"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "23cb998f",
"en_raw": "'Don't go in,' huh..."
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "9285e7f1",
"en_raw": "True, if it comes to this"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "bda2f369",
"en_raw": "I shouldn't have gone in"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "3f3a3d60",
"en_raw": "This is no time"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "c83cf625",
"en_raw": "to be saying that"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "6ef142ee",
"en_raw": "...Even if something happened"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "e7d4b556",
"en_raw": "I don't think it's too late yet"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "a0a56ec3",
"en_raw": "Right, let's hurry"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "d450f5e8",
"en_raw": "Nao, there was definitely"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "422ff215",
"en_raw": "nobody there, right?"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "daceb105",
"en_raw": "Yeah, they must have gone home"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "4d24347c",
"en_raw": "Tch, I hurried for nothing"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "d3401cf5",
"en_raw": "Not at all, I'm relieved"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "2a13245f",
"en_raw": "...There was a little kid"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "32c32044",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao, do you think"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "5b37a903",
"en_raw": "we can just go home?"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "2ae6d6b4",
"en_raw": "Yeah, let's go home"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "8a5a4de1",
"en_raw": "We got scolded..."
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "d30be25b",
"en_raw": "But what if..."
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "1d372166",
"en_raw": "that young cop, who looks like"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "52546367",
"en_raw": "my older brother,"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "049d8400",
"en_raw": "were overlooking a crisis that's"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "896dcd3e",
"en_raw": "really happening, because of"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "f3e978f4",
"en_raw": "some terrible mistake?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "669f0912",
"en_raw": "Could something like that happen?"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "06469d5b",
"en_raw": "...I don't think it can't"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "e59d7476",
"en_raw": "Because what Kurumi saw"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "fb2c55c6",
"en_raw": "wasn't there, you know"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "3d680d9b",
"en_raw": "Or else Miss Shiina"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "aa69b9b6",
"en_raw": "here"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "216ce3b3",
"en_raw": "is actually a big liar"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "1e0ecdbb",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't lie"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "7b017b26",
"en_raw": "Then"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "0851b262",
"en_raw": "will you prove it for us?"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "a72e7390",
"en_raw": "Miss Shiina"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "32122c6b",
"en_raw": "Is the little kid still there?"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "e819fb45",
"en_raw": "Yeah, I guess..."
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "dc81ffa1",
"en_raw": "Hard to say..."
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "93089c33",
"en_raw": "Nao, you too"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "e2692976",
"en_raw": "should get honestly angry sometimes"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "79425a6a",
"en_raw": "Because there are parents like that"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "5ae8d602",
"en_raw": "no decent parents get raised"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "f50e165c",
"en_raw": "But maybe we should still"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "19bb2b43",
"en_raw": "tell the police..."
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "5460cb0d",
"en_raw": "Nah, just leave it"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "42bfda8c",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "97e8466b",
"en_raw": "Enough!"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "b83310d7",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I'm"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "2b127eed",
"en_raw": "just bored of it"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "b4d5b496",
"en_raw": "That was a strange incident"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "d88bc995",
"en_raw": "...Strange? Strange?"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "9ebb58be",
"en_raw": "Is it okay to dismiss this abnormal"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "261c5a81",
"en_raw": "incident with a word like that?"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "edd949fe",
"en_raw": "...Who on earth was that"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "08682eb2",
"en_raw": "self-proclaimed mother?"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "9c05edc7",
"en_raw": "Toward her own child"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "fcd2cdba",
"en_raw": "saying it's not her child..."
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "76f2a0cc",
"en_raw": "So what, did we"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "12054804",
"en_raw": "save the wrong kid?"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "eb66ba8a",
"en_raw": "She must have been confused"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "849807b0",
"en_raw": "Don't be ridiculous"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "48981bb7",
"en_raw": "Besides, her attitude toward"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "c59e0ba5",
"en_raw": "the police was weird too"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "04fa351f",
"en_raw": "True, that..."
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "0d816472",
"en_raw": "was so"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "38b8867e",
"en_raw": "Hey, maybe"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "0f56d286",
"en_raw": "it's connected somehow"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "487fe67e",
"en_raw": "to the incident five years ago?"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "290157ca",
"en_raw": "How so?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "d3fc07bf",
"en_raw": "According to my deduction"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "719930d8",
"en_raw": "that woman did it five years ago too"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "e8bf5a42",
"en_raw": "...Did what?"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "50c0c4c7",
"en_raw": "In that place, disguised as an accident"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "9cc16cc2",
"en_raw": "she killed a child..."
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "c11d84a4",
"en_raw": "Is that what the police officer"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "60d43358",
"en_raw": "was talking about?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "8e6fd417",
"en_raw": "Yes, and for some reason"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "19e3b9a0",
"en_raw": "she brought her child there again..."
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "6ea79919",
"en_raw": "I don't think that's right"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "076d8a33",
"en_raw": "Naturally"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "c81239f8",
"en_raw": "Would anyone be dumb enough to repeat"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "3b09e907",
"en_raw": "the same crime in the same place?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "2630fdbf",
"en_raw": "I was just daydreaming a bit"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "1ee1073a",
"en_raw": "In the end, we ran around"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "8b947237",
"en_raw": "got scolded, and just got tired"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "a16e333b",
"en_raw": "Poor thing..."
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "e45e0815",
"en_raw": "I'm glad the boy got out"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "482942fd",
"en_raw": "What are you saying, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "1b37726b",
"en_raw": "That kid was a girl"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "a8d30418",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Redevelopment Area"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "5bf8c306",
"en_raw": "...This is a true story"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "c573389a",
"en_raw": "That self-proclaimed mother, back then"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "076a5fca",
"en_raw": "the daughter we saved, her own"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "7ba99689",
"en_raw": "she tried to roast on a stove"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "2c9c5c67",
"en_raw": "but her husband stopped her, they say"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "ccbf6c24",
"en_raw": "Sango is making things up again"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "ae0c47eb",
"en_raw": "I told you, it's true!"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}